  "articleBody": "Knowing when to tackle storm-damaged drywall yourself and when to bring in a professional can be tricky. But there are definitely signs that point towards needing expert help. You should consider calling in a pro like HH Remodeling LLC if your wall has sagged, crumbled, or warped – that's usually a clear indicator of significant structural compromise. Visible mold or even just a persistent musty odor means mold is likely present and needs professional remediation. If the water that caused the damage was contaminated, like from a sewer backup, you absolutely need a professional due to health risks. Exposed electrical outlets or wiring near the damaged area also make it a job for someone who understands safety protocols. Finally, if the damaged area is quite large, or if you suspect permit or insurance issues might come into play, a qualified professional can help navigate those complexities and ensure a proper, lasting repair.",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-09"
}